            <div xml:id="d836">

                <pb facs="0827" n="729" sameAs="frus:frus1930v02/pg729"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">836.48 1930 Hurricane/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Hoover to President Trujillo</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-04">September 4, 1930</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am shocked and grieved to learn of the terrible storm disaster which has
                    wrought such devastation in Santo Domingo and I hasten to send you my own deep
                    sympathy and that of my fellow citizens with your suffering people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert Hoover</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
